{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A TRUE COOP EXPERIENCE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Citadel's many challenges solo or in a party up to 4 players. On higher difficulties, take on roles like DPS, Healer or Tank to face the brutal encounters that awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CHALLENGING RAID BOSSES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the Citadel's Guardians with their unique set of mechanics that will reward players for understanding how they attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/45c8b06ff63cbd87c1038fe70272c924.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/45c8b06ff63cbd87c1038fe70272c924.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/45c8b06ff63cbd87c1038fe70272c924.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CHOOSE YOUR OWN WAY TO PLAY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Loadout by selecting 4 abilities from over 45 abilities as well as your suit and your weapon. During your expedition, build your character up with numerous passives that will change the way you play each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b657466b079c46e5a467861c5b88943a.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b657466b079c46e5a467861c5b88943a.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b657466b079c46e5a467861c5b88943a.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>LOOT BETTER AND STRONGER WEAPONS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rifles, Lasers, Rocket Launchers and Melee Weapons are all part of the vast arsenal that you will encounter in the Citadel. Upgrading your weapons with unique modifiers and effects to adapt them to your teams' needs will be a crucial part of your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/1928cd66ba6fadc22fa1e7c2239378b4.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/1928cd66ba6fadc22fa1e7c2239378b4.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/1928cd66ba6fadc22fa1e7c2239378b4.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DISCOVER THE EVER-CHANGING CITADEL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a procedurally generated world, the  citadel will challenge you with new layouts and encounters each time you explore. With Cursed Weapons, drones to help you out, altars to modify your weapons and more, the Citadel has many secrets for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b13e35cebb8b20421e6a078944451bd0.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b13e35cebb8b20421e6a078944451bd0.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/b13e35cebb8b20421e6a078944451bd0.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What was that thing?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892090/ae11f4fcf245b1eb9a38cb62b4c253305b9db1ac.jpg"},{"name":"Cool off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892090/c77c7ceac911118d7093c4978672ef19349991f9.jpg"},{"name":"Lights on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892090/d6e821f5193690dcb3e00f384649761767eafe8f.jpg"},{"name":"Freaking space wasps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892090/a02312ea0dfb420062f0eaf42ef8244692d81acd.jpg"},{"name":"Rocks shouldn't move","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892090/b516a1ab05af3fb08232f0d707d7bf43c023ffd9.jpg"},{"name":"Where are we anyways?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image