eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/8c91184bf1bbc42782c8dca0c373d4e6.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/8c91184bf1bbc42782c8dca0c373d4e6.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A TRUE COOP EXPERIENCE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Citadel's many challenges solo or in a party up to 4 players. On higher difficulties, take on roles like DPS, Healer or Tank to face the brutal encounters that awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.webm?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/5545c7026c83f082b3bd08aa8cf63a29.mp4?t=1771261218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CHALLENGING RAID BOSSES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the Citadel's Guardians with their unique set of mechanics that will reward players for understanding how they attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/45c8b06ff63cbd87c1038fe70272c924.poster.avif?t=1771261218\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892090/extras/45c8b06ff63cbd87c1038fe70272c924.webm?t=1771261218\" ty